        <pre class="pa-code pa-code--html mb-4">&lt;!-- Force all items to start side --&gt;
&lt;ul class="pa-timeline pa-timeline--alternating pa-timeline--start"&gt;...&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;!-- Force all items to end side --&gt;
&lt;ul class="pa-timeline pa-timeline--alternating pa-timeline--end"&gt;...&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;!-- Preserve zig-zag layout on mobile --&gt;
&lt;ul class="pa-timeline pa-timeline--alternating pa-timeline--keep-layout"&gt;...&lt;/ul&gt;</pre>

        <h4>Best Practices</h4>
        <ul class="pa-list-basic">
            <li>Use <code>pa-timeline--alternating</code> for project roadmaps and milestone timelines</li>
            <li>Add icons to timeline items for visual interest</li>
            <li>Use <code>pa-timeline--start</code>/<code>--end</code> for narrow cards where zig-zag would feel cramped</li>
            <li>Use <code>pa-timeline--keep-layout</code> when the design must hold its alternating shape across breakpoints</li>
            <li>For long lists, pair <code>pa-timeline__scroll-container</code> with an IntersectionObserver for lazy loading</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
